WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.700
A bar chart is a natural display for a nominal
variable The bar lengths

00:00:05.726 --> 00:00:11.273
show counts which are quantitative The category
labels themselves

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:17.208
are not treated as measurements We can reorder the
categories by frequency

00:00:17.235 --> 00:00:21.787
or by a conventional order without implying that O
minus A has any numerical meaning

00:00:23.547 --> 00:00:27.783
This is a good example of matching a visualization
to the measurement structure
